      "path": "stellar/scf-starforge-20261009/sf30-seller-sdk/fred/ui/index.html",
      "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Economic editions</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/style.css\"></head>\n<body>\n<header><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">STELLAR FORGE</p><h1>Economic editions</h1><p id=\"project-title\">Opening project…</p></div><button id=\"refresh\" type=\"button\">Refresh state</button></header>\n<p class=\"source-notice\">This product uses the FRED® API but is not endorsed or certified by the Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis. By using this application, users agree to the <a href=\"https://fred.stlouisfed.org/docs/api/terms_of_use.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FRED API Terms of Use</a>.</p>\n<nav aria-label=\"Workspace sections\"><button data-tab=\"source\" class=\"active\">Source</button><button data-tab=\"editions\">Editions & review</button><button data-tab=\"recurring\">Recurring briefings</button><button data-tab=\"county\">County reports</button><button data-tab=\"research\">Research sources</button><button data-tab=\"releases\">Release planner</button><button data-tab=\"ddp\">DDP migration</button><button data-tab=\"published\">Current publications</button><button data-tab=\"publication\">Merchant</button><button data-tab=\"customer\">Customer</button><button data-tab=\"recovery\">History & handover</button></nav>\n<main>\n<div id=\"message\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n<section id=\"summary\" class=\"metrics\" aria-label=\"Project summary\"></section>\n<section data-panel=\"source\">\n<h2>Original economic source</h2><p>Choose the series and observation interval, then select the date on which the information was known. Each capture retains its original source responses and the complete selected pages.</p>\n<form id=\"selection-form\" class=\"form-grid\">\n<label class=\"wide\">FRED series IDs<textarea id=\"series\" rows=\"2\" required></textarea><small>One original ID per line or comma. Series keep their original frequency and units.</small></label>\n<label>Vintage date<input id=\"as-of\" type=\"date\" required></label><label>Observation start<input id=\"start-date\" type=\"date\" required></label><label>Observation end<input id=\"end-date\" type=\"date\" required></label>\n<label>Source page size<input id=\"page-size\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"100000\" required></label><label>Combined row capacity<input id=\"max-rows\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"1000000\" required></label>\n<div class=\"wide buttons\"><button type=\"submit\">Save selection</button><button type=\"button\" id=\"capture\">Acquire selected source</button></div>\n</form>\n<div class=\"box\"><h3>Import retained source</h3><p>Import an original API capture or a complete retained official public-table JSON. Public tables keep the actual retrieval date and published source metadata.</p><label>Capture file<input id=\"capture-file\" type=\"file\" accept=\".json,application/json\"></label><button id=\"import-capture\">Import source</button></div>\n<h3>Selected acquisition</h3><pre id=\"acquisition-state\">No acquisition is running.</pre>\n</section>\n<section data-panel=\"editions\" hidden>\n<h2>Retained editions</h2><label>Source capture<select id=\"capture-select\"></select></label>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"select-capture\">Select this capture</button><button id=\"download-source\">Download original capture</button></div>\n<div id=\"series-detail\"></div>\n<h3>Original observations</h3><div class=\"inline\"><label>Series<select id=\"row-series\"></select></label><span id=\"row-count\"></span></div><div id=\"observations\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"rows-previous\">Previous page</button><button id=\"rows-next\">Next page</button></div>\n<div class=\"box\"><h3>Combine retained public tables</h3><p>Select one original capture for each series to create a shared economic edition. Every observation keeps its own frequency, units and retrieval date.</p><label>Original source captures<select id=\"combine-captures\" multiple size=\"5\"></select></label><button id=\"combine-tables\">Create combined edition</button></div>\n<div class=\"box\"><h3>Review the customer edition</h3><p>Keep the original value, missing marker, date basis, units and frequency together. Configure the original dataset’s selected fields and query capabilities.</p>\n<label>Projection and page policy<textarea id=\"policy\" rows=\"13\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea></label><label>Review note<textarea id=\"review-note\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"8000\"></textarea></label><div id=\"briefing-editor\" class=\"briefing-editor\">\n<label class=\"check\"><input id=\"briefing-enabled\" type=\"checkbox\">Include an analyst briefing in this reviewed edition</label>\n<div id=\"briefing-controls\" hidden>\n<p>Select original series and a reporting interval. Period comparisons use the exact source calendar, including baselines before this interval. Missing values remain visible.</p>\n<div class=\"form-grid\"><label class=\"wide\">Briefing title<input id=\"briefing-title\" maxlength=\"160\" value=\"Economic briefing\"></label>\n<label>Reporting start<input id=\"briefing-start\" type=\"date\"></label><label>Reporting end<input id=\"briefing-end\" type=\"date\"></label><label>Relative-change decimals<input id=\"briefing-decimals\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" value=\"6\"></label></div>\n<h4>Original series and comparison methods</h4><div id=\"briefing-series\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div>\n<p class=\"briefing-method\">Absolute changes preserve the source units. Changes in a series measured in Percent are percentage points. Relative percent change is a separate explicit selection; it is calculated from the two original values.</p>\n<label>Analyst note<textarea id=\"briefing-notes\" rows=\"4\" maxlength=\"8000\"></textarea></label>\n<button type=\"button\" id=\"briefing-preview\">Preview complete briefing selection</button>\n</div></div>\n<button id=\"save-review\">Save reviewed edition</button></div>\n<div class=\"box\" id=\"briefing-report-panel\">\n<h3>Analyst briefings</h3><p>Open a saved briefing or preview the current selection. The offline HTML, full measures CSV, report JSON and manifest are retained with the source review and included in complete project exports.</p>\n<label>Saved briefing<select id=\"briefing-saved\"></select></label>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"briefing-open\">Open saved briefing</button><button id=\"briefing-copy\">Use this briefing selection</button><button id=\"briefing-html\">Download offline HTML</button><button id=\"briefing-csv\">Download full CSV</button><button id=\"briefing-json\">Download report JSON</button><button id=\"briefing-manifest\">Download manifest</button></div>\n<p id=\"briefing-view-state\" role=\"status\">Select an original source to author a briefing.</p>\n<div id=\"briefing-summary\" class=\"metrics\"></div><div id=\"briefing-series-summary\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div>\n<div id=\"briefing-measures\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div><div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"briefing-previous\" disabled>Previous measures</button><button id=\"briefing-next\" disabled>Next measures</button></div>\n<p id=\"briefing-method-summary\" class=\"briefing-method\"></p>\n</div>\n\n<h3>Compare two retained vintages</h3><div class=\"form-grid\"><label>Earlier capture<select id=\"compare-before\"></select></label><label>Later capture<select id=\"compare-after\"></select></label></div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"compare\">Compare source editions</button><button id=\"download-comparison\">Download full comparison</button></div><pre id=\"comparison-summary\">Select the same series and observation interval in two captures.</pre><div id=\"comparison\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"compare-previous\">Previous changes</button><button id=\"compare-next\">Next changes</button></div>\n</section>\n\n<section data-panel=\"recurring\" hidden>\n<h2>Recurring briefings</h2>\n<p>Save a reviewed briefing's series and comparison methods, then apply that selection to later retained source. Each saved successor keeps its original report and a comparison with the selected predecessor.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/recurring-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Operating guide and command reference</a></p>\n<div id=\"recurring-recovery\" class=\"box\" hidden><h3>Saved action</h3><p id=\"recurring-recovery-text\"></p><div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"recurring-resume\">Continue saved action</button><button id=\"recurring-discard\">Clear unsent browser request</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<h3>Save a briefing template</h3>\n<form id=\"template-form\" class=\"form-grid\">\n<label class=\"wide\">Saved analyst briefing<select id=\"template-review\" required></select></label>\n<label class=\"wide\">Template name<input id=\"template-name\" maxlength=\"160\" required></label>\n<label>Calendar months<input id=\"template-months\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"1200\" value=\"12\" required></label>\n<label>Window anchor<select id=\"template-anchor\"><option value=\"latest_all\">Earliest latest observation date across the selected series</option><option value=\"latest_any\">Latest observation date across the selected series</option></select></label>\n<label>Months to omit at the end<input id=\"template-lag\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"1200\" value=\"0\" required></label>\n<label>Earlier template version<select id=\"template-previous\"><option value=\"\">Create a new template</option></select></label>\n<p class=\"wide briefing-method\">Monthly windows include complete calendar months. Quarterly and annual source dates label their observation periods. Missing observations remain part of the source and its coverage.</p>\n<div class=\"wide\"><button type=\"submit\" id=\"template-save\">Save template</button></div>\n</form>\n</div>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<h3>Prepare the next briefing</h3>\n<div class=\"form-grid\">\n<label class=\"wide\">Template<select id=\"recurring-template\"></select></label>\n<label class=\"wide\">Retained source capture<select id=\"recurring-capture\"></select></label>\n<label>Compare with<select id=\"recurring-previous\"><option value=\"\">Original template briefing</option></select></label>\n<label>Specific observation date, optional<input id=\"recurring-anchor\" type=\"date\"><small>Leave empty to use the template's saved anchor rule.</small></label>\n<label class=\"wide\">Review note<textarea id=\"recurring-note\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"8000\"></textarea></label>\n</div>\n<div id=\"recurring-template-detail\"></div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"recurring-preview\">Preview next briefing</button><button id=\"recurring-save\" disabled>Save reviewed successor</button></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<h3>Saved successor history</h3>\n<label>Successor<select id=\"recurring-history\"></select></label>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"recurring-open\">Open successor</button><button id=\"recurring-use\">Continue from this successor</button><button id=\"recurring-report\">Open saved briefing</button><button id=\"recurring-html\">Download offline comparison</button><button id=\"recurring-csv\">Download full comparison CSV</button><button id=\"recurring-json\">Download complete comparison JSON</button></div>\n<p>Publish a saved successor through the existing Merchant section. Its reviewed source, report and payment terms remain part of the same economic project.</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"recurring-report-panel\" class=\"box\">\n<h3>Source coverage and changes</h3>\n<p id=\"recurring-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Choose a template and retained source to preview the next briefing.</p>\n<div id=\"recurring-summary\" class=\"metrics\"></div>\n<h4>Source coverage</h4><div id=\"recurring-coverage\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div>\n<h4>Changes in series meaning</h4><div id=\"recurring-meaning\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div>\n<h4>Changes in source context</h4><div id=\"recurring-source\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div>\n<label class=\"check\"><input id=\"recurring-changes-only\" type=\"checkbox\" checked>Show changed comparisons only</label>\n<div id=\"recurring-changes\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"recurring-previous-page\" disabled>Previous comparisons</button><button id=\"recurring-next-page\" disabled>Next comparisons</button></div>\n<p id=\"recurring-page\"></p>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n<section data-panel=\"county\" hidden>\n<h2>County wage reports</h2>\n<p>Turn the original BLS Quarterly Census of Employment and Wages into a reusable regional report. Keep the employment, wage, price and disclosure choices together for each reporting quarter.</p>\n<p id=\"qcew-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Opening county report production…</p>\n<div id=\"qcew-summary\" class=\"metrics\" aria-label=\"County report inventory\"></div>\n<div id=\"qcew-recovery\" class=\"box\" hidden><h3>Continue your saved action</h3><p id=\"qcew-recovery-text\"></p>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"qcew-resume\" type=\"button\">Continue saved action</button><button id=\"qcew-clear-request\" type=\"button\">Clear completed or unsent request</button></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"box\"><h3>1. Retain the original sources</h3>\n<form id=\"qcew-source-form\" class=\"form-grid\">\n<label class=\"wide\">BLS source location<select id=\"qcew-input-mode\"><option value=\"intake\">Complete original intake on this host</option><option value=\"capture\">Sealed source capture file</option></select></label>\n<label id=\"qcew-intake-field\" class=\"wide\">Original intake directory<input id=\"qcew-intake\" placeholder=\"/absolute/path/to/bls-intake\" autocomplete=\"off\"><small>Use the complete source intake produced by the included BLS collector.</small></label>\n<label id=\"qcew-capture-field\" class=\"wide\" hidden>Complete QCEW capture<input id=\"qcew-capture-file\" type=\"file\" accept=\".json,application/json\"><small>Original compressed CSV members and their complete source manifest stay together.</small></label>\n<div class=\"wide buttons\"><button id=\"qcew-import\" type=\"submit\">Import BLS source</button></div>\n</form>\n<details><summary>Import the original price index</summary><p>Use a complete CPI capture or retained official public-table JSON. Existing economic captures are also available in the production form.</p>\n<form id=\"qcew-cpi-form\" class=\"form-grid\"><label class=\"wide\">Price source file<input id=\"qcew-cpi-file\" type=\"file\" accept=\".json,application/json\" required></label><div class=\"wide\"><button id=\"qcew-import-cpi\" type=\"submit\">Import price source</button></div></form></details>\n<h4>Retained BLS sources</h4><div id=\"qcew-source-list\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"box\"><h3>2. Save the report profile</h3>\n<div class=\"form-grid\"><label class=\"wide\">Saved profile<select id=\"qcew-profile-load\"></select></label><div class=\"wide buttons\"><button id=\"qcew-open-profile\" type=\"button\">Use saved profile</button><button id=\"qcew-default-profile\" type=\"button\">Use San Francisco template</button><button id=\"qcew-download-profile\" type=\"button\">Download selected profile</button></div></div>\n<form id=\"qcew-profile-form\" class=\"form-grid\">\n<label>Profile name<input id=\"qcew-profile-name\" maxlength=\"160\" required></label>\n<label class=\"wide\">Report title<input id=\"qcew-profile-title\" maxlength=\"200\" required></label>\n<label>Focus region name<input id=\"qcew-focus-label\" maxlength=\"120\" required></label>\n<label>Focus area codes<input id=\"qcew-focus-areas\" required><small>One or more original five-character BLS area codes, separated by commas.</small></label>\n<label>Comparison year<input id=\"qcew-baseline\" type=\"number\" min=\"1990\" max=\"2100\" required></label>\n<label>History begins<input id=\"qcew-history-start\" type=\"number\" min=\"1990\" max=\"2100\" required></label>\n<label>Employment measure<select id=\"qcew-employment\"><option value=\"quarter_mean\">Mean of the three monthly counts</option><option value=\"month3\">Third-month count</option></select></label>\n<label>Wage measure<select id=\"qcew-wage-method\"><option value=\"from_totals\">Quarterly wages divided by covered employment and 13 weeks</option><option value=\"published_weighted\">Employment-weighted published weekly wages</option></select></label>\n<label>Regional coverage<select id=\"qcew-coverage\"><option value=\"complete\">Require every selected component</option><option value=\"disclosed_components\">Use disclosed components and label incomplete totals</option></select></label>\n<label>Dollar basis<select id=\"qcew-dollar-basis\"><option value=\"constant\">Constant dollars</option><option value=\"nominal\">Nominal dollars</option></select></label>\n<label>Price series<input id=\"qcew-price-series\" maxlength=\"50\" required></label>\n<label>Quarterly price index<select id=\"qcew-price-quarter\"><option value=\"quarter_end\">Quarter-end month</option><option value=\"quarter_mean\">Mean of the three months</option></select></label>\n<label>Publisher<input id=\"qcew-publisher\" maxlength=\"160\" required></label>\n<label>Publisher contact<input id=\"qcew-publisher-contact\" maxlength=\"240\"></label>\n<label>Sponsor name<input id=\"qcew-sponsor\" maxlength=\"160\"></label>\n<label class=\"wide\">Sponsor line<input id=\"qcew-sponsor-line\" maxlength=\"240\"></label>\n<div class=\"wide\"><h4>Regions and industries in this profile</h4><div id=\"qcew-profile-context\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div><div id=\"qcew-profile-industries\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div></div>\n<details class=\"wide\"><summary>Advanced profile definition</summary><p>Use the complete definition to change comparator regions, industry groupings, ownership, historical tables or the fixed price base. Apply it to the form before saving.</p>\n<label>Complete profile JSON<textarea id=\"qcew-profile-json\" rows=\"16\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea></label>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"qcew-apply-profile-json\" type=\"button\">Apply definition</button></div></details>\n<div class=\"wide buttons\"><button id=\"qcew-save-profile\" type=\"submit\">Save reusable profile</button></div>\n</form></div>\n\n<div class=\"box\"><h3>3. Produce a reporting quarter</h3>\n<form id=\"qcew-produce-form\" class=\"form-grid\">\n<label class=\"wide\">BLS source edition<select id=\"qcew-produce-source\" required></select></label>\n<label class=\"wide\">Saved report profile<select id=\"qcew-produce-profile\" required></select></label>\n<label class=\"wide\">Price-index source<select id=\"qcew-produce-cpi\" required></select></label>\n<label>Reporting year<input id=\"qcew-report-year\" type=\"number\" min=\"1990\" max=\"2100\" required></label>\n<label>Quarter<select id=\"qcew-report-quarter\"><option value=\"1\">Q1</option><option value=\"2\">Q2</option><option value=\"3\">Q3</option><option value=\"4\">Q4</option></select></label>\n<label>Previous edition<select id=\"qcew-produce-previous\"><option value=\"\">First edition</option></select></label>\n<label class=\"check wide\"><input id=\"qcew-pdf\" type=\"checkbox\"> Include a PDF generated from the finished report</label>\n<p id=\"qcew-pdf-state\" class=\"wide briefing-method\"></p>\n<div class=\"wide buttons\"><button id=\"qcew-produce\" type=\"submit\">Produce complete edition</button></div>\n</form></div>\n\n<div class=\"box\" id=\"qcew-report-panel\"><h3>Saved reports and original data</h3>\n<label>Report edition<select id=\"qcew-edition\"></select></label>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"qcew-open-edition\" type=\"button\">Open report</button><button id=\"qcew-use-edition\" type=\"button\">Use as the next edition’s predecessor</button><button id=\"qcew-publish-selected\" type=\"button\">Publish selected report</button></div>\n<p id=\"qcew-report-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Produce a reporting quarter or open a saved edition.</p>\n<div id=\"qcew-report-metrics\" class=\"metrics\"></div><div id=\"qcew-downloads\" class=\"buttons\"></div>\n<div id=\"qcew-charts\" class=\"qcew-charts\"></div>\n<div class=\"form-grid\">\n<label>Report table<select id=\"qcew-section\"><option value=\"overview\">Current industry summary</option><option value=\"matrix\">Calculated regional history</option><option value=\"sources\">Original source rows and disclosure</option><option value=\"files\">Original source files</option><option value=\"changes\">Changes from the previous edition</option></select></label>\n<label>Region<select id=\"qcew-filter-region\"><option value=\"\">All regions</option></select></label>\n<label>Industry<select id=\"qcew-filter-industry\"><option value=\"\">All industries</option></select></label>\n<label>Period<select id=\"qcew-filter-period\"><option value=\"\">All periods</option></select></label></div>\n<div id=\"qcew-report-table\" class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"County report data\" tabindex=\"0\"></div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"qcew-page-previous\" type=\"button\">Previous rows</button><span id=\"qcew-page\"></span><button id=\"qcew-page-next\" type=\"button\">Next rows</button></div>\n<details><summary>Calculation and source context</summary><div id=\"qcew-methodology\"></div></details>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"box\"><h3>4. Hand over the complete project</h3>\n<p>The handover includes every retained QCEW and price source, saved profile, report edition, comparison and the economic project’s existing work.</p>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"qcew-export-project\" type=\"button\">Download complete project</button><button id=\"qcew-download-original\" type=\"button\">Download selected BLS source</button></div>\n<form id=\"qcew-receive-form\" class=\"form-grid\">\n<label class=\"wide\">Complete project handover<input id=\"qcew-receive-file\" type=\"file\" accept=\".json,application/json\" required></label>\n<label class=\"wide\">Receiving directory on this host<input id=\"qcew-receive-directory\" placeholder=\"/absolute/path/to/received-project\" autocomplete=\"off\" required><small>Choose a new private directory. Continuing the same receiving operation reuses its original result.</small></label>\n<div class=\"wide buttons\"><button id=\"qcew-receive\" type=\"submit\">Receive complete project</button></div></form>\n<p id=\"qcew-received-status\" role=\"status\"></p><div id=\"qcew-received-detail\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section data-panel=\"releases\" hidden>\n<h2>Release calendar and vintage capture</h2>\n<p>Watch the series used by your briefings, retain the published calendar and vintage history, then collect the observation editions you choose. Release dates help schedule work; returned vintage dates identify available editions.</p>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<h3>Save a release watch</h3>\n<form id=\"release-watch-form\" class=\"form-grid\">\n<label class=\"wide\">Watch name<input id=\"release-watch-name\" maxlength=\"160\" required></label>\n<label class=\"wide\">Briefing template<select id=\"release-watch-template\"></select><small>A linked template carries its full series selection into this watch.</small></label>\n<label class=\"wide\">Series IDs<textarea id=\"release-watch-series\" rows=\"2\" required></textarea><small>One original FRED series ID per line or comma.</small></label>\n<label>Observation start<input id=\"release-watch-start\" type=\"date\" required></label>\n<label>First vintage already considered<input id=\"release-watch-baseline\" type=\"date\" required></label>\n<label>Capture policy<select id=\"release-watch-policy\"><option value=\"all_vintages\">Every selected vintage</option><option value=\"latest_vintage\">Latest available selected vintage</option></select></label>\n<label class=\"check wide\"><input id=\"release-watch-end-current\" type=\"checkbox\" checked> Use each selected vintage date as the observation end</label>\n<label>Fixed observation end<input id=\"release-watch-end\" type=\"date\" disabled></label>\n<div class=\"buttons wide\"><button id=\"release-watch-save\" type=\"submit\">Save watch</button></div>\n</form>\n</div>\n<h3>Choose the watch and capture its source</h3>\n<div class=\"form-grid\">\n<label class=\"wide\">Saved watch<select id=\"release-watch\"></select></label>\n<p id=\"release-watch-detail\" class=\"wide\"></p>\n</div>\n<form id=\"release-source-form\" class=\"form-grid\">\n<label>Series metadata as of<input id=\"release-as-of\" type=\"date\" required></label>\n<label>Calendar from<input id=\"release-calendar-start\" type=\"date\" required></label>\n<label>Calendar through<input id=\"release-calendar-end\" type=\"date\" required></label>\n<label>Vintage history from<input id=\"release-vintage-start\" type=\"date\" required></label>\n<label>Vintage history through<input id=\"release-vintage-end\" type=\"date\" required></label>\n<label>Rows per source request<input id=\"release-page-size\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"10000\" step=\"1\" value=\"1000\" required></label>\n<label>Combined source row capacity<input id=\"release-max-rows\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"1000000\" step=\"1\" value=\"100000\" required></label>\n<div class=\"buttons wide\"><button id=\"release-capture\" type=\"submit\">Capture calendar and vintage history</button></div>\n</form>\n<details class=\"box\"><summary>Import a complete source capture</summary>\n<p>Open an original release capture collected in another workspace.</p>\n<label>Original JSON capture<input id=\"release-import-file\" type=\"file\" accept=\".json,application/json\"></label>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"release-import\" type=\"button\" disabled>Import source</button></div>\n</details>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<h3>Inspect retained source</h3>\n<div class=\"form-grid\">\n<label class=\"wide\">Source capture<select id=\"release-source\"></select></label>\n<label>Source table<select id=\"release-source-section\"><option value=\"calendar\">Release calendar</option><option value=\"vintages\">Available vintage dates</option><option value=\"series\">Series metadata</option><option value=\"releases\">Release definitions</option></select></label>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"release-source-open\" type=\"button\">Open source</button><button id=\"release-source-download\" type=\"button\">Download full source</button></div>\n</div>\n<p id=\"release-source-context\"></p>\n<div id=\"release-source-table\" class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Retained release source\" tabindex=\"0\"></div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"release-source-prev\" type=\"button\">Previous source rows</button><span id=\"release-source-page\"></span><button id=\"release-source-next\" type=\"button\">Next source rows</button></div>\n</div>\n<h3>Review the capture plan</h3>\n<div class=\"form-grid\">\n<label>Earlier source capture<select id=\"release-before\"></select></label>\n<label>Current source capture<select id=\"release-after\"></select></label>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"release-plan-preview\" type=\"button\">Preview capture plan</button><button id=\"release-plan-save\" type=\"button\" disabled>Save reviewed plan</button></div>\n</div>\n<p id=\"release-plan-status\">Select a watch and its retained source to preview the observation editions available for collection.</p>\n<section id=\"release-plan-summary\" class=\"metrics\" aria-label=\"Release plan summary\"></section>\n<p id=\"release-plan-coverage\"></p>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"release-fill-history\" type=\"button\" hidden>Use the complete history interval</button></div>\n<div class=\"form-grid\">\n<label class=\"wide\">Saved plan<select id=\"release-plan\"></select></label>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"release-plan-open\" type=\"button\">Open saved plan</button><button id=\"release-plan-download\" type=\"button\">Download full plan</button></div>\n<label>Plan table<select id=\"release-plan-section\"><option value=\"acquisitions\">Observation captures</option><option value=\"calendarChanges\">Calendar changes</option><option value=\"vintageChanges\">Vintage changes</option><option value=\"events\">Capture reasons</option><option value=\"schedule\">Release schedule</option></select></label>\n</div>\n<div id=\"release-plan-table\" class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Reviewed release plan\" tabindex=\"0\"></div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"release-plan-prev\" type=\"button\">Previous plan rows</button><span id=\"release-plan-page\"></span><button id=\"release-plan-next\" type=\"button\">Next plan rows</button></div>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<h3>Capture a planned observation edition</h3>\n<p>Choose a date from the saved plan. The workspace collects all watched series at that same vintage, retaining the complete original observation responses.</p>\n<div class=\"form-grid\">\n<label>Planned vintage<input id=\"release-capture-vintage\" type=\"date\" list=\"release-vintage-options\"><datalist id=\"release-vintage-options\"></datalist></label>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"release-vintage-capture\" type=\"button\">Capture selected vintage</button></div>\n<label class=\"wide\">Completed captures<select id=\"release-completed\"></select></label>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"release-open-observations\" type=\"button\">Open observation source</button><button id=\"release-open-briefing\" type=\"button\">Review recurring briefing</button></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"release-recovery\" class=\"box\" hidden>\n<h3>Continue a saved action</h3><p id=\"release-recovery-text\"></p>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"release-resume\" type=\"button\">Continue original action</button><button id=\"release-discard\" type=\"button\">Clear browser request</button></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section data-panel=\"ddp\" hidden>\n<h2>Federal Reserve DDP migration</h2>\n<p>Bring an original DDP package into this economic workspace, review its FRED series mappings, then compare the retained observations and continue the reporting work.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/ddp-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Migration and receiving guide</a> · <a href=\"https://www.federalreserve.gov/data/data-download-fred-information.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Federal Reserve transition information</a></p>\n<div id=\"ddp-recovery\" class=\"box\" hidden><h3>Continue a saved action</h3><p id=\"ddp-recovery-text\"></p><div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"ddp-resume\" type=\"button\">Continue original action</button><button id=\"ddp-discard\" type=\"button\">Clear browser request</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<h3>Retain the official series crosswalk</h3>\n<p>The original release and Board series identifier select the FRED mapping. Each saved crosswalk keeps the complete published CSV and its source details.</p>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"ddp-crosswalk-capture\" type=\"button\">Capture the official crosswalk</button></div>\n<form id=\"ddp-crosswalk-import-form\" class=\"form-grid\">\n<label class=\"wide\">Original crosswalk CSV or retained source JSON<input id=\"ddp-crosswalk-file\" type=\"file\" accept=\".csv,.json,text/csv,application/json\" required></label>\n<div class=\"wide buttons\"><button id=\"ddp-crosswalk-import\" type=\"submit\">Import crosswalk</button></div>\n</form>\n<div class=\"form-grid\"><label class=\"wide\">Saved crosswalk<select id=\"ddp-crosswalk\"></select></label><label>Release filter<input id=\"ddp-crosswalk-release\" placeholder=\"For example, H15\"></label><label>Series search<input id=\"ddp-crosswalk-query\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Board or FRED series ID\"></label></div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"ddp-crosswalk-open\" type=\"button\">Open mappings</button><button id=\"ddp-crosswalk-original\" type=\"button\">Download original CSV</button><button id=\"ddp-crosswalk-download\" type=\"button\">Download complete source</button></div>\n<p id=\"ddp-crosswalk-context\"></p>\n<div id=\"ddp-crosswalk-table\" class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Original crosswalk rows\" tabindex=\"0\"></div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"ddp-crosswalk-prev\" type=\"button\">Previous mappings</button><span id=\"ddp-crosswalk-page\"></span><button id=\"ddp-crosswalk-next\" type=\"button\">Next mappings</button></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<h3>Import the original DDP package</h3>\n<p>Use the original downloaded archive, XML, or CSV. The archive carries its source dictionaries alongside the observations. Keep any original bookmark with the reporting selection below.</p>\n<form id=\"ddp-package-import-form\" class=\"form-grid\">\n<label class=\"wide\">Original package or retained source JSON<input id=\"ddp-package-file\" type=\"file\" accept=\".zip,.xml,.csv,.json,application/zip,application/xml,text/xml,text/csv,application/json\" required></label>\n<label>Original release identifier<input id=\"ddp-package-release\" maxlength=\"100\" placeholder=\"For example, H15\" required></label>\n<label>Package format<select id=\"ddp-package-format\"><option value=\"board-sdmx-zip\">Board SDMX archive</option><option value=\"board-sdmx-xml\">Board SDMX XML</option><option value=\"ddp-csv\">DDP CSV</option></select></label>\n<label class=\"wide\">XML source dictionaries, when downloaded separately<input id=\"ddp-package-supplements\" type=\"file\" accept=\".xml,.xsd,application/xml,text/xml\" multiple></label>\n<label id=\"ddp-csv-layout-label\" class=\"wide\" hidden>CSV source column mapping<textarea id=\"ddp-csv-layout\" rows=\"5\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"Use the original layout definition from the migration guide when the CSV omits its labels.\"></textarea><small>The saved layout records which original columns supply the series identity, periods, values and metadata.</small></label>\n<div class=\"wide buttons\"><button id=\"ddp-package-import\" type=\"submit\">Import original package</button></div>\n</form>\n<div class=\"form-grid\"><label class=\"wide\">Saved package<select id=\"ddp-package\"></select></label><label>Source frequency<select id=\"ddp-package-frequency\"><option value=\"\">All original frequencies</option></select></label><label>Series search<input id=\"ddp-package-query\" type=\"search\"></label></div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"ddp-package-open\" type=\"button\">Open original series</button><button id=\"ddp-package-original\" type=\"button\">Download original package</button><button id=\"ddp-package-download\" type=\"button\">Download complete source</button></div>\n<p id=\"ddp-package-context\"></p><div id=\"ddp-package-summary\" class=\"metrics\"></div>\n<div id=\"ddp-package-table\" class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Original package series\" tabindex=\"0\"></div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"ddp-package-prev\" type=\"button\">Previous series</button><span id=\"ddp-package-page\"></span><button id=\"ddp-package-next\" type=\"button\">Next series</button></div>\n<h4>Original observations</h4><label>Original package series<select id=\"ddp-observation-series\"></select></label>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"ddp-observation-open\" type=\"button\">Open source observations</button></div>\n<div id=\"ddp-observation-table\" class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Original DDP observations\" tabindex=\"0\"></div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"ddp-observation-prev\" type=\"button\">Previous observations</button><span id=\"ddp-observation-page\"></span><button id=\"ddp-observation-next\" type=\"button\">Next observations</button></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<h3>Save the migration selection</h3>\n<form id=\"ddp-migration-form\" class=\"form-grid\">\n<label class=\"wide\">Migration name<input id=\"ddp-migration-name\" maxlength=\"500\" required></label>\n<label class=\"wide\">Original DDP bookmark, when available<input id=\"ddp-bookmark\" type=\"url\" placeholder=\"https://www.federalreserve.gov/datadownload/...\"></label>\n<p class=\"wide\">The migration retains the whole selected package. Review any series exclusions, ambiguous mappings or explicit unit and calendar choices below.</p>\n<label>Original date policy<select id=\"ddp-date-policy\"><option value=\"source\">The original package interval</option><option value=\"fixed\">Fixed observation interval</option><option value=\"last\">Last observations for each series</option></select></label>\n<label id=\"ddp-last-label\" hidden>Number of observations<input id=\"ddp-last-count\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" step=\"1\" value=\"120\"></label>\n<label id=\"ddp-start-label\">Observation start<input id=\"ddp-start\" type=\"date\" required></label>\n<label id=\"ddp-end-label\">Observation end<input id=\"ddp-end\" type=\"date\" required></label>\n<label>FRED edition as of<input id=\"ddp-as-of\" type=\"date\" required></label>\n\n<label>Rows per FRED source request<input id=\"ddp-page-size\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"100000\" step=\"1\" value=\"10000\" required></label>\n<label>Combined observation capacity<input id=\"ddp-max-rows\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"1000000\" step=\"1\" value=\"100000\" required></label>\n<label class=\"wide\">Analyst note<textarea id=\"ddp-migration-note\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"8000\"></textarea></label>\n<div class=\"wide buttons\"><button id=\"ddp-migration-preview\" type=\"submit\">Preview complete migration</button><button id=\"ddp-migration-save\" type=\"button\" disabled>Save reviewed migration</button></div>\n</form>\n\n<details id=\"ddp-decisions\" class=\"box\">\n<summary>Review a mapping, exclusion, or source meaning</summary>\n<p>Series choices follow the original source filters and displayed page. Choose an original package series. A mapped target must come from its retained crosswalk candidates. Record the reason for each explicit decision.</p>\n<div class=\"form-grid\">\n<label class=\"wide\">Original package series<select id=\"ddp-decision-series\"></select></label>\n<label>Mapping choice<select id=\"ddp-decision-action\"><option value=\"automatic\">Use the original crosswalk</option><option value=\"map\">Choose a published candidate</option><option value=\"exclude\">Exclude this series from acquisition</option></select></label>\n<label>Published FRED candidate<select id=\"ddp-decision-target\"></select></label>\n<label class=\"wide\">Decision reason<textarea id=\"ddp-decision-note\" rows=\"2\" maxlength=\"4000\"></textarea></label>\n<div class=\"wide buttons\"><button id=\"ddp-decision-apply\" type=\"button\">Retain mapping choice</button><button id=\"ddp-decision-remove\" type=\"button\">Restore original mapping</button></div>\n</div>\n<h4>Explicit comparison meaning</h4>\n<p>The original metadata supplies the default meaning. Use an explicit binding when the reviewed source needs a particular calendar rule or scale; the full binding stays with the comparison.</p>\n<div class=\"form-grid\">\n<label>Period matching<select id=\"ddp-binding-period\"><option value=\"\">Original source calendar</option><option value=\"exact\">Exact source date</option><option value=\"month\">Same calendar month</option><option value=\"quarter\">Same calendar quarter</option><option value=\"semiannual\">Same half year</option><option value=\"year\">Same calendar year</option></select></label>\n<label>Source value multiplier<input id=\"ddp-binding-source-scale\" value=\"1\" inputmode=\"decimal\"></label>\n<label>FRED value multiplier<input id=\"ddp-binding-target-scale\" value=\"1\" inputmode=\"decimal\"></label>\n<label>Expected FRED units<input id=\"ddp-binding-units\"></label>\n<label>Expected FRED frequency<input id=\"ddp-binding-frequency\"></label>\n<label>Expected FRED seasonal adjustment<input id=\"ddp-binding-adjustment\"></label>\n<label class=\"wide\">Binding reason<textarea id=\"ddp-binding-note\" rows=\"2\" maxlength=\"4000\"></textarea></label>\n<div class=\"wide buttons\"><button id=\"ddp-binding-apply\" type=\"button\">Retain comparison meaning</button><button id=\"ddp-binding-remove\" type=\"button\">Restore original source meaning</button></div>\n</div>\n<h4>Retained mapping decisions</h4><div id=\"ddp-decision-table\" class=\"table-wrap\" tabindex=\"0\"></div>\n<h4>Retained comparison bindings</h4><div id=\"ddp-binding-table\" class=\"table-wrap\" tabindex=\"0\"></div>\n</details>\n<p id=\"ddp-migration-status\" role=\"status\">Choose a retained package, crosswalk and original reporting selection.</p>\n<div id=\"ddp-migration-summary\" class=\"metrics\"></div>\n<div class=\"form-grid\"><label class=\"wide\">Saved migration<select id=\"ddp-migration\"></select></label><label>Migration table<select id=\"ddp-migration-section\"><option value=\"mappings\">Series mappings</option><option value=\"series\">Selected source series</option><option value=\"acquisitions\">Observation acquisition</option></select></label></div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"ddp-migration-open\" type=\"button\">Open saved migration</button><button id=\"ddp-migration-download\" type=\"button\">Download full migration</button></div>\n<div id=\"ddp-migration-table\" class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Migration mapping and source review\" tabindex=\"0\"></div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"ddp-migration-prev\" type=\"button\">Previous migration rows</button><span id=\"ddp-migration-page\"></span><button id=\"ddp-migration-next\" type=\"button\">Next migration rows</button></div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"ddp-migration-acquire\" type=\"button\">Acquire the reviewed FRED selection</button></div>\n<p>The saved package is acquired as one operation. Completed original source requests are retained when that operation continues after an interruption.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<h3>Review and receive the completed migration</h3>\n<label>Saved comparison<select id=\"ddp-receiving\"></select></label>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"ddp-receiving-open\" type=\"button\">Open comparison</button><button id=\"ddp-receiving-html\" type=\"button\">Download offline HTML</button><button id=\"ddp-receiving-csv\" type=\"button\">Download full CSV</button><button id=\"ddp-receiving-json\" type=\"button\">Download full JSON</button></div>\n<p id=\"ddp-receiving-context\" role=\"status\"></p><div id=\"ddp-receiving-summary\" class=\"metrics\"></div>\n<div class=\"form-grid\"><label>Comparison table<select id=\"ddp-receiving-section\"><option value=\"observations\">Original observations</option><option value=\"meanings\">Series meaning and review</option></select></label><label>Original series filter<select id=\"ddp-receiving-series\"><option value=\"\">All retained series</option></select></label><label class=\"check\"><input id=\"ddp-receiving-changes\" type=\"checkbox\" checked>Show differences only</label></div>\n<div id=\"ddp-receiving-table\" class=\"table-wrap\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"DDP and FRED source comparison\" tabindex=\"0\"></div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"ddp-receiving-prev\" type=\"button\">Previous comparison rows</button><span id=\"ddp-receiving-page\"></span><button id=\"ddp-receiving-next\" type=\"button\">Next comparison rows</button></div>\n<label>Retained FRED source<select id=\"ddp-result-capture\"></select></label>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"ddp-open-observations\" type=\"button\">Open economic source and briefing editor</button><button id=\"ddp-use-release-watch\" type=\"button\">Use this selection for a release watch</button><button id=\"ddp-export-project\" type=\"button\">Export complete project handover</button></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section data-panel=\"published\" hidden>\n<h2>Current publications</h2>\n<p>Compare every mapped Board period with the complete current FRED publication. Each edition retains its original files, collection dates, saved calendar rules, native project and complete customer report.</p>\n<div class=\"box\"><h3>Complete publication edition</h3>\n<label>Saved migration<select id=\"published-migration\"></select></label>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"published-start\" type=\"button\">Collect complete publication edition</button><button id=\"published-resume\" type=\"button\">Continue original operation</button><button id=\"published-refresh\" type=\"button\">Refresh editions</button></div>\n<p>A new edition collects the complete mapped population into its own retained intake. Continue an interrupted operation to use its original request and completed source files.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/ddp-published-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Complete guide and existing-programme attachment</a></p>\n</div>\n<label>Retained publication edition<select id=\"published-operation\"></select></label>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"published-open\" type=\"button\">Open original edition</button><button id=\"published-inventory-prev\" type=\"button\">Previous editions</button><span id=\"published-inventory-page\"></span><button id=\"published-inventory-next\" type=\"button\">Next editions</button></div>\n<pre id=\"published-operation-state\" aria-live=\"polite\">Select a retained edition or its saved migration.</pre>\n<details><summary>Complete edition history</summary><div id=\"published-operation-history\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div></details>\n<div class=\"box\"><h3>Complete customer files</h3><p>The edition archive includes every original Board and FRED source, the saved migration, native project bundle, complete comparison rows, report and source inventory.</p>\n<label>Original edition file<select id=\"published-file\"></select></label><code id=\"published-file-details\" class=\"published-digest\"></code>\n<button id=\"published-download\" type=\"button\">Download complete original file</button></div>\n<h3>Published-data comparison</h3><p id=\"published-report-context\"></p><div id=\"published-summary\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div>\n<label>Find an original series<input id=\"published-series-query\" type=\"search\" maxlength=\"500\" placeholder=\"Board series, FRED series or title\"></label>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"published-report-open\" type=\"button\">Find series</button><button id=\"published-series-prev\" type=\"button\">Previous series</button><span id=\"published-series-page\"></span><button id=\"published-series-next\" type=\"button\">Next series</button></div>\n<div id=\"published-series-table\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div>\n<h3>Original observation rows</h3>\n<div class=\"form-grid\"><label>Original series on this page<select id=\"published-row-series\"><option value=\"\">All original series</option></select></label>\n<label>Comparison result<select id=\"published-row-status\"><option value=\"\">Every original result</option><option value=\"EQUAL\">Equal figures</option><option value=\"DIFFERENT\">Different figures</option><option value=\"MISSING_CHANGED\">Availability differs</option><option value=\"BOTH_MISSING\">Unavailable in both</option><option value=\"SOURCE_ONLY\">Board periods only</option><option value=\"TARGET_ONLY\">FRED periods only</option></select></label></div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"published-rows-open\" type=\"button\">Open original rows</button><button id=\"published-rows-prev\" type=\"button\">Previous rows</button><span id=\"published-row-page\"></span><button id=\"published-rows-next\" type=\"button\">Next rows</button></div>\n<p>Values retain their original numeric strings and unavailable codes. Differences use FRED minus Board after the saved scale factors. Byte ranges locate each row in its original source file.</p>\n<div id=\"published-row-meaning\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div><div id=\"published-row-table\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div>\n</section>\n<section data-panel=\"publication\" hidden>\n<h2>Operate a published economic edition</h2><p>Select a saved source review or complete county report and use the merchant’s public payment terms. Each publication retains its original files and public resource paths.</p><p><a href=\"/county-merchant-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">County report publication and receiving guide</a></p>\n<form id=\"publication-form\" class=\"form-grid\"><label class=\"wide\">Publication kind<select id=\"publication-kind\"><option value=\"FRED\">Reviewed FRED source or briefing</option><option value=\"QCEW\">Complete county report</option></select></label><label class=\"wide\" id=\"publication-review-field\">Saved review<select id=\"review-select\"></select></label><label class=\"wide\" id=\"publication-county-field\" hidden>Saved county report<select id=\"qcew-merchant-edition\"></select></label><label>Public HTTPS origin<input id=\"public-origin\" type=\"url\" placeholder=\"https://your-merchant.example\" required></label><label>Resource path<input id=\"public-path\" value=\"/economic-data\" required></label>\n<label class=\"wide\">Public payment terms<textarea id=\"payment\" rows=\"9\" spellcheck=\"false\" required></textarea><small>Use your configured scheme, network, token contract, atomic amount, recipient and timeout.</small></label><div class=\"wide buttons\"><button id=\"publish-button\" type=\"submit\">Publish selected edition</button><button id=\"county-publish-continue\" type=\"button\" hidden>Continue saved county publication</button></div><p id=\"county-publication-status\" class=\"wide\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p></form>\n<h3>Retained merchant</h3><label>Publication<select id=\"publication-select\"></select></label><div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"open-publication\">Open publication</button><button id=\"merchant-start\">Start original seller</button><button id=\"merchant-stop\">Stop and retain seller</button></div>\n<pre id=\"merchant-state\">Select a publication.</pre><div id=\"publication-detail\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div><div id=\"publication-files\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div>\n<div id=\"publication-data-preview\"><label>Original dataset query<textarea id=\"preview-query\" rows=\"2\" spellcheck=\"false\">limit=25</textarea></label><button id=\"preview\">Preview original dataset</button><div id=\"preview-result\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div></div>\n</section>\n<section data-panel=\"customer\" hidden>\n<h2>Receive the original edition</h2><p>Prepare the exact published request and inspect its terms. The configured original buyer asks for approval in the terminal and retains its attempt and delivered bytes.</p>\n<p id=\"buyer-status\"></p><div class=\"form-grid\"><label class=\"wide\">Publication<select id=\"customer-publication\"></select></label><label class=\"wide\">Resource<select id=\"customer-file\"><option value=\"\">Observation page</option></select></label><label>Stable intent<input id=\"intent\" maxlength=\"96\"></label><label>Payment alternative<input id=\"accept-index\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" value=\"0\"></label><label class=\"wide\">Original page query<textarea id=\"customer-query\" rows=\"3\" spellcheck=\"false\">limit=25</textarea></label></div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"new-customer-request\">New request</button><button id=\"prepare\">Prepare this request</button><button id=\"buy\">Review and execute original purchase</button><button id=\"recover\">Reopen original result</button><button id=\"download-customer\">Download retained delivery</button><button id=\"next-customer-page\">Prepare next page selection</button></div>\n<h3>Saved requests</h3><select id=\"request-select\"></select><button id=\"open-request\">Select saved request</button>\n<pre id=\"customer-result\">The original request, selected terms and retained result appear here.</pre><div id=\"customer-rows\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div>\n\n<div id=\"county-purchase-receiving\" class=\"box\" hidden>\n<h3>Receive the purchased county report</h3>\n<p>The complete report package carries the original report files and predecessor editions. Its receiving destination stays with the same purchase.</p>\n<form id=\"county-receive-purchase-form\" class=\"form-grid\">\n<label class=\"wide\">Customer receiving directory<input id=\"county-purchase-directory\" placeholder=\"/absolute/path/to/customer-report\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label>\n<div class=\"wide buttons\"><button id=\"county-receive-purchase\" type=\"submit\">Receive or continue original report</button><button id=\"county-open-receiving\" type=\"button\">Open saved receiving</button></div>\n</form>\n<p id=\"county-customer-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n<div id=\"county-customer-receipt\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div>\n<label>Received report edition<select id=\"county-received-edition\"></select></label>\n<div id=\"county-customer-downloads\" class=\"buttons\"></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section data-panel=\"research\" hidden><div id=\"research-workspace\"></div></section>\n<section data-panel=\"recovery\" hidden>\n<h2>History and receiving</h2><p>The project retains source captures, saved review decisions, publications and completed operation identities. Resume an interrupted source acquisition with the same operation.</p>\n<pre id=\"pending\">No pending operation.</pre><div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"resume\">Continue original acquisition</button><button id=\"abandon\">Abandon pending action and retain its files</button><button id=\"download-bundle\">Export complete project</button></div>\n<h3>Completed operations</h3><div id=\"history\" class=\"table-wrap\"></div>\n<p>To open a complete handover on another host, use <code>starforge fred receive --project /absolute/empty-directory --source /absolute/received-project.json</code>, then serve that same directory. Configure the receiving host’s existing buyer and facilitator when starting its workspace.</p>\n</section>\n</main>\n<footer>Original FRED source · retained vintage and units · native Stellar Forge seller and buyer</footer>\n<script type=\"module\" src=\"/app.js\"></script>\n</body></html>\n",
